      "hideComponent": "false",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 23 2020 19:03:57 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Ronda</span>&nbsp;Stryker</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><br>\n</span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Director since 1984, Governance and Nominating Committee<br>\n </span></span><br>\nVice Chair and a Director of Greenleaf Trust<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ms. Stryker is the granddaughter of the founder of Stryker and daughter of a former President of the company. She is also Vice Chair and a Director of Greenleaf Trust, a Michigan chartered bank, Vice Chair of Spelman College and member of the Harvard Medical School Board of Fellows.<br>\n</p>\n<p>Ms. Stryker brings a strong interest in advocating the benefits of diversity and various matters regarding social responsibility. As one of our largest individual shareholders and a member of the founding family, she brings a strong shareholder perspective, unlike that of any other member of our Board, making her a valuable contributor to our Board.<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jul 14 2025 18:24:28 GMT+0000",
